WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Narrator: Crowds gather fast.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:07.100
Noura: Please give us some room - the medics are coming.

3
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:12.400
Narrator: Ask the person's friends and your colleagues to help form a calm ring.

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.100
Faisal: Please put your phone away - thank you

5
00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:26.100
Narrator: Protect their dignity - and no filming.

6
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:31.000
Narrator: Keep a route open for the medics, and keep the stairs moving.

